  "sourceTitle": "Healthy Fruit Chaat",
  "sourceText": "Healthy Fruit Chaat\nBy: Usha Chowdhary Gupta\nPublished: Saturday, December 11, 2010 - 9:10pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 APPLE,\n1 BANANA,\n1 PEARS,\n1 POMEGRANATE,\n1 KIWI,\n10 GRAPES, STRAWBERRIES,\n10 pieces PINEAPPLE,  OR any other Fruits\nCHAAT MASALA: MIX TOGETHER SALT, PEPPER\nPOWDER, CASTOR SUGAR, BLACK SALT AND CHAAT\nMASALA TO CREATE OWN MASALA\n\nPreparation\n\n1 CUT THE FRUITS IN SMALL CUBES MAKE OWN CHAAT MASALA AND MIX WITH ALL THE FRUITS. SERVE COLD.",
